<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms of Service (lol)</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Boogaloo&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      :root {
        --yellow: #ffd93d;
        --orange: #ff6b35;
        --dark: #1a1a2e;
        --card: #16213e;
        --text: #eaeaea;
        --muted: #8892b0;
        --green: #06d6a0;
        --red: #ef233c;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: var(--dark);
        background-image: radial-gradient(
            ellipse at 20% 20%,
            rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15) 0%,
            transparent 50%
          ),
          radial-gradient(
            ellipse at 80% 80%,
            rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.1) 0%,
            transparent 50%
          );
        font-family: "Nunito", sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .floating-emojis span {
        position: fixed;
        font-size: 2rem;
        animation: floatUp linear infinite;
        opacity: 0.12;
        pointer-events: none;
        user-select: none;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(1) {
        left: 5%;
        animation-duration: 9s;
        animation-delay: 0s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(2) {
        left: 15%;
        animation-duration: 12s;
        animation-delay: 2s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(3) {
        left: 30%;
        animation-duration: 8s;
        animation-delay: 1s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(4) {
        left: 50%;
        animation-duration: 11s;
        animation-delay: 3s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(5) {
        left: 70%;
        animation-duration: 10s;
        animation-delay: 0.5s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(6) {
        left: 85%;
        animation-duration: 7s;
        animation-delay: 4s;
      }
      .floating-emojis span:nth-child(7) {
        left: 92%;
        animation-duration: 13s;
        animation-delay: 1.5s;
      }

      @keyframes floatUp {
        0% {
          transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(0deg);
          opacity: 0;
        }
        10% {
          opacity: 0.12;
        }
        90% {
          opacity: 0.12;
        }
        100% {
          transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(360deg);
          opacity: 0;
        }
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--card);
        border: 2px solid rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.2);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 680px;
        position: relative;
        box-shadow:
          0 25px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
          0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        animation: slideIn 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
      }

      @keyframes slideIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.97);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
        }
      }

      .badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -18px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        background: var(--yellow);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        padding: 4px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.4);
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        color: var(--yellow);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .subtitle strong {
        color: var(--orange);
      }

      /* Big honest box */
      .honest-box {
        background: rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.07);
        border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.35);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .honest-box .big-emoji {
        font-size: 4rem;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        animation: wobble 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      @keyframes wobble {
        0%,
        100% {
          transform: rotate(-5deg);
        }
        50% {
          transform: rotate(5deg);
        }
      }

      .honest-box h2 {
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: var(--yellow);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .honest-box p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .honest-box p strong {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      /* Fake section */
      .section {
        margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.8rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      }
      .section:last-of-type {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--orange);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .section p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .section p strong {
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .section p em {
        color: var(--green);
        font-style: normal;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* Redacted text effect */
      .redacted {
        background: var(--text);
        color: transparent;
        border-radius: 3px;
        user-select: none;
        cursor: not-allowed;
        transition: background 0.3s;
      }
      .redacted:hover {
        background: var(--orange);
      }

      /* Timer */
      .read-timer {
        background: rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.25);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .read-timer p {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .read-timer .timer-count {
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--green);
      }

      /* Back button */
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.9rem;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-family: "Boogaloo", cursive;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        background: var(--yellow);
        color: var(--dark);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition:
          transform 0.15s,
          box-shadow 0.15s;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.35);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.45);
      }

      .last-updated {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      @media (max-width: 520px) {
        .card {
          padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
        }
        h1 {
          font-size: 2rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="floating-emojis" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>📜</span><span>😴</span><span>🥱</span><span>💤</span>
      <span>📋</span><span>🙈</span><span>✍️</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="badge">📄 Last read by an actual human: Never</div>

      <h1>Terms of Service 📜</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        The legal stuff. Or at least, it <strong>looks</strong> like the legal
        stuff. Scroll to the bottom fast enough and you'll feel very
        accomplished.
      </p>

      <!-- Honest confession box -->
      <div class="honest-box">
        <span class="big-emoji">🫣</span>
        <h2>Okay, fine. We'll be honest.</h2>
        <p>
          We have <strong>absolutely zero terms and conditions</strong> written
          here. None. Zilch. Nada. Because let's be real —
          <strong>you were never going to read them anyway.</strong>
          You scrolled here, skimmed the first sentence, and your finger was
          already hovering over the "I Agree" button before the page even
          loaded. We respect that hustle. We really do. 🫡
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Fake read timer -->
      <div class="read-timer">
        <p>⏱️ Estimated time you've spent reading so far:</p>
        <span class="timer-count" id="timerCount">0.0 seconds</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Fake sections for comedic effect -->
      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">📌 Section 1 — General Stuff</div>
        <p>
          By using our service you agree that you are a
          <em>real human being</em> and not a raccoon in a trenchcoat. We have
          had issues with this before and we are <strong>not</strong> legally
          allowed to discuss it. The
          <span class="redacted">incident of 2022</span> is behind us and we
          have moved on. Hover over the black bars if you're curious. We dare
          you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">🍪 Section 2 — Cookies</div>
        <p>
          We use cookies. Not the good kind, unfortunately — we checked and our
          lawyers said we couldn't mail you actual cookies. So it's the digital
          kind. They track stuff. You know the deal. You've clicked "Accept All"
          on approximately
          <strong>4,000 other websites</strong> this year alone. One more won't
          hurt. 🍪
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">🔒 Section 3 — Your Data</div>
        <p>
          We collect your data and use it to
          <span class="redacted">take over the world</span> improve your
          experience. We definitely do <strong>not</strong> sell it to
          <span class="redacted">shadowy corporations</span> third-party
          partners. Your information is stored safely in a
          <span class="redacted">volcano</span>
          secure database. Pinky promise. 🤙
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">⚖️ Section 4 — Liability</div>
        <p>
          If anything goes wrong — and we mean <em>anything</em> — it's probably
          your fault. Just kidding. Maybe. We are not responsible for: lost
          sleep, existential dread, arguments with your significant other about
          how much time you spend on here, or spontaneous urges to refresh the
          page 47 times in a row. Those are
          <strong>pre-existing conditions.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">🚪 Section 5 — Termination</div>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to terminate your account at any time, for any
          reason, or for
          <em>no reason at all</em>, like if Mercury is in retrograde or someone
          on our team is having a bad day. Kidding. Mostly. Please don't make us
          use this section. We actually like you. <strong>A lot.</strong> Don't
          leave. 🥺
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">🎉 Section 6 — The TL;DR</div>
        <p>
          Don't be evil. Don't break things. Don't blame us when things break
          themselves. Be cool. That's it. That's the whole terms of service. If
          every legal document was this short,
          <strong>lawyers would be out of a job</strong>
          and honestly the world might be a better place. We said what we said.
          🤷
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/" class="btn">✅ &nbsp;Yeah yeah, I agree — take me back!</a>

      <p class="last-updated">
        Last updated: Sometime. Probably a Tuesday. Does it matter? You didn't
        read it anyway.
      </p>
    </div>

    <script>
      // Funny read timer
      const start = Date.now();
      const timerEl = document.getElementById("timerCount");
      const jokes = [
        " seconds — a new record!",
        " seconds — are you… actually reading?!",
        " seconds — okay now you're just showing off.",
        " seconds — we're genuinely impressed and a little scared.",
        " seconds — please, you have a life to live.",
        " seconds — we'll name a server after you.",
      ];
      setInterval(() => {
        const elapsed = ((Date.now() - start) / 1000).toFixed(1);
        const idx = Math.min(Math.floor(elapsed / 10), jokes.length - 1);
        timerEl.textContent = elapsed + jokes[idx];
      }, 100);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
